ofile":{"Age":[15],"Height":[152],"Weight":[41]},"tribes":["人类"],"story":"海尔佛，传说国度拜拉尔的剑士。\n\n纯真无邪，对人关怀备至的捣蛋鬼。剑术精湛，富有正义感。\n\n拯救了受到邪恶猪怪袭击而濒临灭亡的拜拉尔王国和王子埃尔达。但不知为何，之后的拜拉尔多次面临灭亡危机，屡次救国有功的海尔佛入睡前总能幻听到一道声音：“苏醒吧，剑士！”。","storyKey":"profile_hyper_story","sources":{"hero":"heroes.json / OriginId=184","profile":"heroprofile.json / OriginId=184","strings":"strings-zhCN.json","items":"items.json / TargetCharacterIds, ExclusiveCharacterId","voiceLines":["strings-zhCN.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-enUS.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-jaJP.json / Voice_*, cv_*"],"voiceAudio":"gtaudio/data/offline-package.json; CharacterVoiceType; heroes.json VoiceId"},"voiceLines":[{"id":"hyper","label":"普通","lines":[{"type":"TouchReactionGood1","label":"触碰反应-积极1","texts":{"zhCN":["嘿，在这儿也建一座剑场，怎么样？"],"enUS":["Hey, what about building a sword farm here?"],"jaJP":["ねぇ、ここに剣の農場を建てるのはどうかな？"]},"keys":["Voice_hyper_1_TouchReactionGood1"],"audio":{"zhCN":[],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"audioName":"1840031"},{"type":"TouchReactionGood2","label":"触碰反应-积极2","texts":{"zhCN":["大师之剑应该和伙伴们相处融洽吧？"],"enUS":["I guess master blade is getting along well with others?"],"jaJP":["森の聖剣は田舎で他の剣と元気に暮らしてるよね？"]},"keys":["Voice_hyper_1_TouchReactionGood2"],"audio":{"zhCN":[],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"audioName":"1840032"},{"type":"TouchReactionBad1","label":"触碰反应-消极1","texts":{"zhCN":["猪怪？按铁匠所说那样做，就做成烤猪了。"],"enUS":["The evil pig monsters? I did what the Blacksmith told me to and they turned into BBQ."],"jaJP":["ブタの怪物？鍛冶屋の言う通りにしたらバーベキューになったよ"]},"keys":["Voice_hyper_1_TouchReactionBad1"],"audio":{"zhCN":[],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"audioName":"1840033"},{"type":"TouchReactionBad2","label":"触碰反应-消极2","texts":{"zhCN":["再说一遍，穿红衣服的是海尔佛！"],"enUS":["Like I told you before, the one with red clothes is Hyper!"],"jaJP":["もう一度言うけど、赤い服を着たのがハイファーだよ！"]},"keys":["Voice_hyper_1_TouchReactionBad2"],"audio":{"zhCN":[],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"audioName":"1840034"},{"type":"NoticeMail","label":"邮件提示","texts":{"zhCN":["邮件！确认邮箱。"],"enUS":["There's new mail! Check the mailbox."],"jaJP":["メールだよ！ポストを確認してみて"]},"keys":["Voice_hyper_1_NoticeMail"],"audio":{"zhCN":[],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"audioName":"1840035"}]}]}
